l, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d3a6ce2fe2eeace3c06ccc6c56962e54636058d5", "message": "Brought the halfway-there restructuring of the datapoint sources and source types to it's logical conclusion. Source type and sources are now treated consequently, and only attributes that aren't covered by actual columns will be stored in the configuration column.\n\nThis will result in automatic value migration and preservation upon save if a column is added to or removed from the table. This way we can expose attributes (a candidate for this is the parser attribute of source types) to SQL-manipulation and querying without changing the api.", "created_at": "2009-04-24T06:57:26Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "021842ffd9d6f3f2df699c8ce2b398b418b3cc37", "message": "Cleanup to meet coding style standards. Won't fix string concatenation style, as it will change to the used style in Drupal 7. I guess the jury is out on the use of camel-case in class methods.", "created_at": "2009-02-19T07:57:06Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "add55466c66acc93aaed7ca77cc1dc91d5047bc2", "message": "Finishing touches on the admin interface and some general cleanup.", "created_at": "2009-02-19T07:29:27Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "09639d61b456a31a4a954e37491af4840ae9433e", "message": "The datapoint interface is now usable, and it's possible to update datapoint sources and source types (if they're not managed).", "created_at": "2009-02-18T22:34:40Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "18cea121ce937a3c9ac0c7feefc207a721ae3b1f", "message": "Added the managed state as a db-column and started work on a admin interface for datapoint sources and source types.", "created_at": "2009-02-16T08:20:25Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b477829b9a45457de2d819097431c22289111da4", "message": "Finalized the work on making node creation voluntary for source types.", "created_at": "2009-02-04T07:37:51Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "06a38ba091a456cd129ee071d46dc380a627378b", "message": "Moved datapoint_parser_info() from datapoint.admin.inc to .module.\n\nAdded doc to datapoint_update_source() and made param $since_last_update optional. datapoint_source() now loads last_update and pinged from db, and these should be used instead.\n\nWhitespace cleanup (Must find textmate fix for this).", "created_at": "2009-02-03T07:42:51Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4f94ee31dc8c73aef07a9d77911b67e7f1e3e1a1", "message": "datapoint_add_source now returns the id of the created source.", "created_at": "2009-02-03T07:14:14Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "390d79c80fcab79e2f9522013c5b3a0ed58a6ba7", "message": "Made it possible to change the default behaviour to re-add vertexes. Also changed strange flow with regards to the point and vertex api hooks.", "created_at": "2009-01-23T16:06:36Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "930e53cf63ac471d943b4340d9136eb7aca731bd", "message": "Taking the first steps towards making the node creation for data point voluntary. Also rewrote the datapoint_vertex_module_schema-function so that the columns are placed in a more logical order.", "created_at": "2009-01-23T08:15:30Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "baa7edea1d5556af37df5c3b16db90f3eae09509", "message": "Ping an cron properly implemented", "created_at": "2008-12-03T07:12:28Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf06db1608b1773fdfc1a07d4d1d758cde56bb2d", "message": "The managed field definition is now passed to the setter to allow the trickery used in the cck integration module. Nessecary changes followed in datapoint and simple geo integration module setters.", "created_at": "2008-12-02T21:40:19Z", "repo": "datapoint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}